      "body": "Closes #7686\n\n## Leak path\nloadStack isolated HOME/XDG_CONFIG_HOME, but config.SearchPathFrom walks up from the working directory to the filesystem root adding config spellings at every ancestor. When TMPDIR lives under the real home (the fleet Go convention TMPDIR=~/tmp), t.TempDir() is under the real home too, and the walk picks up the host real ~/.config/mcpx/config.json — merging every server the host defines into the fixture stack.\n\nReproduced on the laptop: TMPDIR=/home/user/tmp go test -run TestConfigLayersProperty FAILS (antigravity, chrome-devtools, cloudrun, ... merged); default TMPDIR passes.\n\n## Fix (test-only)\n- loadStack passes the fixture layer files as the paths.config seed, nearest first; a no-null seed replaces the default walk outright (config.ResolveChainFrom pass 1), so the chain is exactly the fixture layers on any machine.\n- New regression guard TestConfigLayersHostIsolation plants host-style configs in the isolated HOME and in an ancestor of the stack directory and asserts merged servers are exactly the fixture stack.\n\n## Tests (laptop, Go 1.26)\n- TMPDIR=/home/user/tmp: TestConfigLayersProperty PASS, TestConfigLayersHostIsolation PASS\n- default TMPDIR: full internal/testsupport/gen package PASS; internal/config PASS\n\nQueue task 14224, lane code-l.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796801487&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8006&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8006&signature=d017b95e5fe031694764dbaa2a1672b3de4b8dcc00ffcab50cff6905650d10f3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8006?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
