      "body": "## Problem → solution\n\nFixes #344 (repair direction).\n\n**Problem:** the goreleaser workflow's *Set up Go* step pointed `go-version-file` / `cache-dependency-path` at `./go.work` / `./go.work.sum` — `go.work` was deleted in Feb 2024 (8ec08d0e), so the next tag push would fail in setup before GoReleaser ever runs. The break was dormant only because no tag has been pushed since v1.2.7 (Nov 2023).\n\n**Solution:**\n- `go-version-file: pkgs/graph/go.mod`, `cache-dependency-path: pkgs/graph/go.sum` — the module `.goreleaser.yaml` actually builds (`dir: sources/graph`; `sources` is a symlink to `pkgs/`), and the same pair `mod-tidy.yml` already uses. Action pins were already aligned to v7 by Renovate since the issue was filed, so no version changes were needed there.\n- Added `workflow_dispatch`: manual runs use `release --snapshot --clean` (no publish, no tag needed) so the workflow can be proven runnable without cutting a release; tag pushes keep `release --clean`.\n- Migrated `.goreleaser.yaml` to the v2 schema the workflow pins (goreleaser v2.18.3): `version: 2` header, `archives.builds` → `ids`, `archives.format` → `formats`, `format_overrides.format` → `formats`. `goreleaser check` failed on the old file (version 0 + three deprecations); the release pipe only warned, but the config was one goreleaser bump from breaking.\n\n## Verification (local, pinned goreleaser v2.18.3 binary — the exact version the workflow installs)\n\n- Reproduced the issue on main 830a8ea1: audit of every workflow's `go-version-file`/`cache-dependency-path` — goreleaser was the only literal reference to a nonexistent file (`./go.work`).\n- `goreleaser check` post-fix: **1 configuration file validated**, no deprecations.\n- `goreleaser release --snapshot --clean` post-fix: **release succeeded after 10m55s** — all 12 targets built (including the `pkgs/graph` build repaired in #166), 12 archives produced (9 tar.gz + 3 Windows zip via the migrated format override), and the pre-build `go mod tidy` hooks left `go.mod`/`go.sum` untouched.\n- Workflow YAML parses; diff is 2 files.\n\nSingle-repo: no goreleaser workflow/config in opencode, openchamber, or dezren39/nix (per the issue's grep verification).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/452?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795141035&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=452&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F452&signature=ba180b8a3d37b68866ec3c2cef0e8434fea60f1b7b329d730b45a0ed40b8756c\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Release Process**\n  * Added support for manually triggered release workflow runs using snapshot builds.\n  * Tag-based releases continue to use the standard release process.\n  * Updated release packaging to generate tar.gz archives and Windows ZIP archives.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
